    <item>
      <title>奇瑞尹同跃宣布2027年全固态电池上车验证 两年砸超百亿</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/%E5%A5%87%E7%91%9E%E5%B0%B9%E5%90%8C%E8%B7%83%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%832027%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BA%E6%80%81%E7%94%B5%E6%B1%A0%E4%B8%8A%E8%BD%A6%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81-%E4%B8%A4%E5%B9%B4%E7%A0%B8%E8%B6%85%E7%99%BE%E4%BA%BF/</link>
